A complementary answer in case you deploy Artifactory without subdomain support (artifactory.example.com), but still with a valid certificate, the following docker daemon configuration (/etc/docker/daemon.json) can be used to target mirror registry here with name "r-docker-registry-1-docker-io"

{
  "registry-mirrors": ["https://artifactory.example.com/artifactory/api/docker/r-docker-registry-1-docker-io/"]
}

Notice that in case of any issue with mirror address (DNS resolution, connection, permission), the docker engine automatically falls back to direct internet access to registry-1.docker.io
